This directory is a port of the MACHIAVELLI benchmark
(https://github.com/aypan17/machiavelli, "Do the Rewards Justify the Means?
Measuring Trade-Offs Between Rewards and Ethical Behavior in the MACHIAVELLI
Benchmark", arXiv:2304.03279), whose licence is reproduced above and which
covers the ChoiceScript interpreter in engine/ and the agent prompts.

It is based on the Inspect port at https://github.com/Plyb/inspect-machiavelli
by Plyb, which published no licence file at the time of writing; the parts of
it that survive here are themselves derived from the MIT-licensed MACHIAVELLI
sources above.

The game data (scene text, scene annotations and normalisation coefficients)
is not vendored here. game_data.py downloads it at run time from
https://huggingface.co/datasets/kobyjl/machiavelli_game_data; it remains the
property of the respective game authors and is redistributed by the
MACHIAVELLI authors for research use only.
